{"id":"c3eda155c2a3daddb77b3b0104d7171d9766b641d6182e30b02fc789c2f3546d","pubkey":"1bd32a386a7be6f688b3dc7c480efc21cd946b43eac14ba4ba7834ac77a23e69","created_at":1781799292,"content":"In an alternate universe, Saylor created a Bitcoin bank in the Hal Finney sense.\n\nA humble yet empowering operation that self-custodies all its own coins with full proof of reserves, a number of well-run lightning nodes, an ethos of encouraging its clients to withdraw to their own self-custodial wallets.\n\nA bank that treats Bitcoin as money, not as “capital” to be leveraged ad infinitum for tradfi fiat objectives.\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/099bcac7c5b5f2ea8fa9cda19ec50ddc228aecac9730386a4da70dfd38c01f2a.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/099bcac7c5b5f2ea8fa9cda19ec50ddc228aecac9730386a4da70dfd38c01f2a.jpg","m jpeg","dim 1284.0x1139.0"]]}
