{"id":"60e48c535ffe24c806d9ab534f1acca0edca3500ff2f83fd5bd8ef4b4e8e09be","pubkey":"26bb2ebed6c552d670c804b0d655267b3c662b21e026d6e48ac93a6070530958","created_at":1781798924,"content":"料金テーブル変わったの知らなかったんですが、Proでアプリからほぼ使ってる自分は恩恵しかなさそう\n\n\nhttps://support.claude.com/en/articles/15036540-use-the-claude-agent-sdk-with-your-claude-plan","tags":[["alt","A short note: 料金テーブル変わったの知らなかったんですが、Proでアプリからほぼ使ってる自分は恩恵しかなさそう\n\n..."],["r","https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15036540-use-the-claude-agent-sdk-with-your-claude-plan"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"7f05993e6258fb8d610b7d7576f8ad1ad399053b9de7ffcffb5df419eb4cc307","pubkey":"bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725","created_at":1781798538,"content":"The philosophy backing the practices he describes in this video is very similar to what I was taught.\n\nIn the past two years since I heard about this story I've talked to about 5 dozen people who have similar stories.\n\nAt psy-gym a lot of the participants had stories from being in this program, the leader was similarly institutionalized in upstate NY like this guy describes. \n\nThe people were exclusively from five eyes nations (US, Canada, UK, Australia and New Zealand). Almost all of us ended up in government or defense industries (unless you were washed out).\n\nThere are different tracks, most popular is mechanics but there is also forecasting or visionary like remote viewing work. \n\nIf you did too well, you went to the advanced programs like this guy describes. I've heard similar testimonies. Many of us, our other side friends told us not to be honest or to purposefully fail the tests so we didn't advance.\n\nIf you were talented but didn't play ball, then you were labeled mentally ill and troubled and often ended up on drugs or in jail. \n\nIt's very dark, but I have tremendous faith that these things happened for a reason and there's something important we've been prepared for that's in God's plan 🙌 \n\nCome spoon bend with me 😁\nhttps://i.nostr.build/Ap7J3YBaLZuauOMN.jpg\nnostr:nevent1qqs0pxk2lxgzxm403uzd7vcfcmjgg56zn6yrwxcff6rmanlpsmp32qqpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhsygy0ga9tkuxrnpll06flmk0qrjadutddt29ng606r2aznxpr588w3ypsgqqqqqqsr8y6xj","tags":[["alt","A short note: The philosophy backing the practices he describes ..."],["p","8f474abb70c3987ff7e93fdd9e01cbade2dad5a8b3469fa1aba299823a1cee89","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","https://i.nostr.build/Ap7J3YBaLZuauOMN.jpg"],["q","f09acaf990236eaf8f04df3309c6e48453429e88371b094e87becfe186c31500","wss://relay.damus.io/","8f474abb70c3987ff7e93fdd9e01cbade2dad5a8b3469fa1aba299823a1cee89"],["zap","8f474abb70c3987ff7e93fdd9e01cbade2dad5a8b3469fa1aba299823a1cee89","wss://nos.lol/","0.5"],["zap","bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725","wss://relay.primal.net/","0.5"],["imeta","url https://i.nostr.build/Ap7J3YBaLZuauOMN.jpg","x 104fdb39d6c47a861f9d4783366818462819521371575f9fbb1e1070da7de253","size 39971","m image/jpeg","dim 756x1008","blurhash _8JHzF00n4-=00~qD%00XSxu?bRit7IUE2Ny9GRj.8M_M|8^?a_3Dj%MniIA_3_3RPD%.7xvM{-qVs9FIotRtQo#.7?uxuM|jFITRj9aD%M{%M.8RPRPWCn%n$M|Rjxtt7","ox 104fdb39d6c47a861f9d4783366818462819521371575f9fbb1e1070da7de253","alt "]]}
