{"id":"262640c37831a4ba57ac99eeb4ecbe4c123a26e89e57f0474578a825eb24e2ff","pubkey":"a74f331e8da74601b3fd86caa2836bf215042d81d1928a67d946257f1de29b03","created_at":1781794744,"content":"“A designer stared at the send button for four days. On the fifth, they made it a circle, said “there,” and went to lunch.\nThe rest of the app got the same treatment — quieter colors, calmer corners, a little more room to breathe. We’d point out everything we changed, but the whole idea was that you wouldn’t notice. So: never mind.\nYour messages remain yours, as always. That part we don’t redesign.”\n\n#confer  #legend #moxie\n\nhttps://i.nostr.build/2rys0goiGILafeKN.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://i.nostr.build/2rys0goiGILafeKN.jpg","blurhash e7RfkC9FD*ayMy~qodM{t7M{?bWAM{xuWBWBt6xuayay?aRkM{ofRj","dim 688x494"],["t","confer"],["t","legend"],["t","moxie"],["r","https://i.nostr.build/2rys0goiGILafeKN.jpg"],["client","Damus"]]}
