{"id":"00000bc2db1798bd94f657427241ac9b1281591ee3b41cba34cb058b78c03b27","pubkey":"3ffac3a6c859eaaa8cdddb2c7002a6e10b33efeb92d025b14ead6f8a2d656657","created_at":1781792457,"content":"https://blossom-espelhator.girino.org/94f318b2b56188a07ce65b7de057bb7fefe8cc66bd90c3fdc1fadfd1de667676.jpg\n\nSocial justice is always and everywhere a SCAM.\n\nLONG LIVE FREEDOM, DAMN IT...!!!\n\nSource: https://web.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122127378003209293&set=a.122101887579209293","tags":[["nude_detector","https://blossom-espelhator.girino.org/94f318b2b56188a07ce65b7de057bb7fefe8cc66bd90c3fdc1fadfd1de667676.jpg sexual_activity 0.001"],["nonce","65856","20"]]}
